  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Baron’s Uncanny Gateway</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Destruction sphere (Admixture), caster level 1st or higher with at least two casting traditions</p>\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong> When using the Admixture talent, you may apply (blast type) talents from other casting traditions you possess. The same is true for applying talents from other spheres to the Admixture if you possess the proper Admixture feats to use them. You apply the boons and drawbacks of all casting traditions which are used as part of the admixture and may divide the spell point cost among any of the traditions used in the admixture. For every casting tradition beyond the first used in the admixture, the save DC of all effects from the admixture increases by 1.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> If you possess the Arcane Combo feat, all but one casting tradition used in the admixture gain the benefits of the caster level increase from Arcane Combo.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/theurge-feats#toc2\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
